# 💻 NaxoOS

NaxoOS is a lightweight WebOS built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript. It recreates the experience of a desktop operating system directly inside your browser.

## ✨ Features

- 🖥️ Interactive desktop environment
- 🪟 Draggable and resizable application windows
- 📁 Functional file explorer with folders and file previews
- 💻 Built-in terminal
- 📝 Notes application
- 🧮 Calculator
- ⚙️ System settings and wallpapers
- 📶 Quick Settings with Wi-Fi and Bluetooth controls
- 🔊 Volume controls
- 🌙 Night Light mode
- 🔔 Notification Center
- 📅 Interactive calendar
- 🔎 Application search
- 🕐 Real-time clock and date
- ⏻ Shutdown and restart system
- 💾 Persistent settings using localStorage
- 📱 Responsive interface

## 🛠️ Built With

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## 🌐 Web Edition

No installation is required. NaxoOS runs directly in a browser.

